{"id":"MYSQL-C003","claim_ko":"MySQL server MDL은 일반 SELECT의 MDL_SHARED_READ, 쓰기 문장의 MDL_SHARED_WRITE, 강한 DDL의 MDL_EXCLUSIVE를 구분하며, 각 connection의 MDL_context가 ticket을 소유한다. statement/transaction/explicit duration은 자동 해제 경계를 달리한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"sql/mdl.h","symbol":"enum_mdl_type","line_start":197,"line_end":330,"file_sha256":"c43186485e83c94018abc88b7490bff7281eaf0a94b5f523932fa6bdc7be43a2","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/mdl.h","symbol":"enum_mdl_duration","line_start":332,"line_end":349,"file_sha256":"c43186485e83c94018abc88b7490bff7281eaf0a94b5f523932fa6bdc7be43a2","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/mdl.h","symbol":"MDL_context","line_start":1410,"line_end":1502,"file_sha256":"c43186485e83c94018abc88b7490bff7281eaf0a94b5f523932fa6bdc7be43a2","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/mdl.cc","symbol":"MDL_context::release_transactional_locks","line_start":4495,"line_end":4522,"file_sha256":"914aadcc4006be4d314db84063d8d458445bf005ae6e3e78982963b2f26ee4a3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"모든 SQL 문법이 만드는 MDL request를 전수 열거한 주장은 아니며, 대표 모드와 owner/duration 경계만 다룬다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-mdl-lifetime"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C004","claim_ko":"InnoDB lock_t는 owner trx_t, transaction lock-list 연결, table 또는 page+bitmap record payload를 가지며, trx_lock_t가 transaction별 lock heap/list/count를 보유한다. 트랜잭션 종료 시 lock queue에서 모두 제거한 뒤 lock heap을 한 번에 비운다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/include/lock0priv.h","symbol":"lock_t","line_start":83,"line_end":171,"file_sha256":"2c035baaf4a24ed0d3d2daa68cdcbf73a81b2c77d89965ecdf530c26b3326ea0","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/include/trx0trx.h","symbol":"trx_locks","line_start":518,"line_end":544,"file_sha256":"8b451929d5ecc4c7677e55055da3da84ae3e351f5a1da3df98f5e4c1653fc1d3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_trx_release_locks","line_start":5797,"line_end":5850,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"AUTO_INC 및 predicate lock의 별도 수명 규칙은 이 claim에 포함하지 않았다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-innodb-lock-lifetime"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C005","claim_ko":"MDL_context::acquire_lock은 즉시 획득 실패 시 waiting ticket을 큐에 넣고 wait-for edge를 등록하며, MDL 자체 deadlock 탐색이 victim을 정한다. release_lock은 ticket을 제거하고 필요한 waiter를 다시 스케줄한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"sql/mdl.cc","symbol":"MDL_context::acquire_lock","line_start":3364,"line_end":3450,"file_sha256":"914aadcc4006be4d314db84063d8d458445bf005ae6e3e78982963b2f26ee4a3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/mdl.cc","symbol":"MDL_context::find_deadlock","line_start":4049,"line_end":4090,"file_sha256":"914aadcc4006be4d314db84063d8d458445bf005ae6e3e78982963b2f26ee4a3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/mdl.cc","symbol":"MDL_context::release_lock","line_start":4100,"line_end":4212,"file_sha256":"914aadcc4006be4d314db84063d8d458445bf005ae6e3e78982963b2f26ee4a3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"InnoDB data-lock wait graph와 합쳐진 단일 탐지기라는 뜻이 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-wait-lifecycle"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C006","claim_ko":"MDL wait와 InnoDB row-lock wait를 함께 포함하는 cycle은 MDL detector에 보이지 않는 edge를 포함할 수 있고, 이 경우 소스 주석이 제시하는 해소 수단은 innodb_lock_wait_timeout 또는 lock_wait_timeout이다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"sql/sql_base.cc","symbol":"open_table_get_mdl_lock","line_start":2638,"line_end":2732,"file_sha256":"2a108465126fceb8e0b996179a912e58a7cb5cd4630f8f7b46366e4816d26e1a","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"모든 cross-subsystem deadlock 유형을 열거한 것이 아니라 table-open 주석에 명시된 MDL/InnoDB 예와 탐지 경계다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-deadlock-boundary"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C007","claim_ko":"InnoDB lock wait timeout은 session 변수이고, deadlock detector를 끄면 timeout에 의존한다. deadlock은 전체 트랜잭션 rollback, timeout은 기본적으로 현재 statement rollback이며 innodb_rollback_on_timeout이 켜지면 전체 트랜잭션 rollback으로 바뀐다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/handler/ha_innodb.cc","symbol":"lock_wait_timeout","line_start":1117,"line_end":1121,"file_sha256":"42e7ad557071037a82440c01e34740615663963711dd5691c9226d69a6ec4ea8","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/handler/ha_innodb.cc","symbol":"rollback_on_timeout","line_start":22415,"line_end":22419,"file_sha256":"42e7ad557071037a82440c01e34740615663963711dd5691c9226d69a6ec4ea8","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/handler/ha_innodb.cc","symbol":"deadlock_detect","line_start":22701,"line_end":22706,"file_sha256":"42e7ad557071037a82440c01e34740615663963711dd5691c9226d69a6ec4ea8","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0mysql.cc","symbol":"row_mysql_handle_errors","line_start":651,"line_end":727,"file_sha256":"08db672d4177b27b5f95a3a4507a0965fe0e3e5991d099a76afa4d37e9489100","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"SQL-layer error text와 client retry 정책은 포함하지 않았고 engine rollback scope에 한정한다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-errors-config"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C008","claim_ko":"고정 revision의 InnoDB table/record lock 경로에는 record-count 기반 table lock escalation이 확인되지 않았으며, transaction lock object가 10000개를 넘고 buffer pool이 고갈 압력에 놓이면 DB_LOCK_TABLE_FULL 오류로 빠져 전체 트랜잭션 rollback이 표시된다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0sel.cc","symbol":"sel_set_rec_lock","line_start":1144,"line_end":1161,"file_sha256":"418edef00f0a8cba8875deac251f0581ceb98f16af99fac296eab2136b78aa1b","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/handler/ha_innodb.cc","symbol":"DB_LOCK_TABLE_FULL","line_start":2253,"line_end":2262,"file_sha256":"42e7ad557071037a82440c01e34740615663963711dd5691c9226d69a6ec4ea8","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"음성 결론은 `rg -n -i \"lock escalation|lock_escalat|escalat(e|ion|ing).*lock|lock.*escalat(e|ion|ing)\" storage/innobase/lock storage/innobase/row storage/innobase/trx storage/innobase/include sql include`의 0 matches와 양의 오류 경로에 한정하며, 다른 revision이나 plugin까지 부정하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-resource-pressure"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C009","claim_ko":"InnoDB lock_sys는 startup에서 trx_sys 뒤에 메모리 구조, wait slots, mutex/event, hash tables로 생성되고, shutdown에서 disk flush와 file close 뒤 trx_sys 다음 순서로 event/mutex/heap을 파기하여 nullptr로 만든다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/srv/srv0start.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_create","line_start":1618,"line_end":1624,"file_sha256":"4f0152b9ca16e7c151063a23a513bdf51ea7fe619d08192128fa35b39bcbd626","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_create","line_start":289,"line_end":316,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/srv/srv0start.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_close","line_start":2759,"line_end":2830,"file_sha256":"4f0152b9ca16e7c151063a23a513bdf51ea7fe619d08192128fa35b39bcbd626","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_close","line_start":433,"line_end":461,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"server 전체 startup/shutdown phase와 fast-shutdown 모든 변형을 설명하는 claim은 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-startup-shutdown"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C012","claim_ko":"InnoDB XA prepare는 undo segment 상태를 file-based world의 PREPARED로 기록하고 mtr commit LSN을 필요에 따라 flush한 뒤 transaction state를 PREPARED로 바꾼다. READ COMMITTED 이하에서는 prepare 시 전체 read lock이 아니라 gap 부분만 조기 해제한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_prepare","line_start":2965,"line_end":3071,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_trx_release_read_locks","line_start":4042,"line_end":4086,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"binary log transaction coordinator와 모든 durability 설정 조합은 추적하지 않았고 InnoDB undo/LSN 및 gap-lock release 경계만 증명한다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-xa-prepared"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C013","claim_ko":"지속 데이터를 변경한 PREPARED InnoDB transaction은 connection close 때 rollback/free되지 않고 mysql_thd에서 분리되어 다른 session의 XA COMMIT/ROLLBACK에 다시 연결될 수 있으며, non-prepared transaction은 close 경로에서 rollback된다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/handler/ha_innodb.cc","symbol":"innobase_close_connection","line_start":6430,"line_end":6503,"file_sha256":"42e7ad557071037a82440c01e34740615663963711dd5691c9226d69a6ec4ea8","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_disconnect_from_mysql","line_start":679,"line_end":728,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"변경이 redo rollback segment에 없는 prepared transaction은 close 시 rollback되는 예외가 있다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-xa-prepared"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C014","claim_ko":"Crash recovery는 undo record를 스캔해 recovered transaction별 table ID 집합을 만들고, prepared 또는 DDL transaction에는 해당 table의 IX lock_t를 다시 생성한다. 일반 recovered transaction의 MDL/IX 획득은 rollback thread로 넘긴다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_resurrect_table_ids","line_start":737,"line_end":818,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_resurrect_locks","line_start":820,"line_end":872,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_table_ix_resurrect","line_start":3611,"line_end":3629,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/srv/srv0start.cc","symbol":"srv_dict_recover_on_restart","line_start":2124,"line_end":2173,"file_sha256":"4f0152b9ca16e7c151063a23a513bdf51ea7fe619d08192128fa35b39bcbd626","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"복원되는 것은 이 경로에서 확인된 table IX이며, crash 직전 record wait queue와 waiter 순서까지 복원된다는 뜻이 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-restart-reconstruction"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C015","claim_ko":"복구된 XA prepared transaction은 PREPARED 상태와 XID를 유지하여 MySQL의 commit/abort 결정을 기다리고 recovery API에 보고되며, background rollback은 PREPARED transaction을 건드리지 않는다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_resurrect_insert","line_start":876,"line_end":963,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_recover_for_mysql","line_start":3227,"line_end":3284,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0roll.cc","symbol":"trx_rollback_or_clean_resurrected","line_start":641,"line_end":705,"file_sha256":"76c46660c6ced1ac4b26a0b40469c45ab2108875ee6a844aaa8a2df741512d36","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"server transaction coordinator가 최종 결정을 내리는 모든 2PC 경로는 포함하지 않았다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-restart-reconstruction"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C016","claim_ko":"Server MDL은 detached prepared XA에 대해 별도 MDL_context_backup_manager가 transaction-duration tickets를 XID별로 clone해 보존한다. 재시작 recovery는 변경 table 목록으로 MDL_SHARED_WRITE request를 획득해 backup context를 만들고, XA second phase 진입 시 이를 THD MDL_context로 복원한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"sql/sql_class.cc","symbol":"THD::cleanup","line_start":1324,"line_end":1360,"file_sha256":"8f4395ada7fd3f97614099310302e740364808c0979730a6ca38397373299149","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/mdl_context_backup.cc","symbol":"MDL_context_backup_manager::create_backup","line_start":157,"line_end":230,"file_sha256":"0d1c4f7be1d877b21dc927e5d46acb5473e1b72f313340d914d7f41311c2b453","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/xa.cc","symbol":"Recovered_xa_transactions::recover_prepared_xa_transactions","line_start":215,"line_end":267,"file_sha256":"77d814f55b942217a01cbff20d7eea85f4f27f6b3e5d62c30fad7867281e0427","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"sql/xa.cc","symbol":"acquire_mandatory_metadata_locks","line_start":396,"line_end":421,"file_sha256":"77d814f55b942217a01cbff20d7eea85f4f27f6b3e5d62c30fad7867281e0427","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"재시작 때 원래 MDL mode를 알 수 없어 modified table에 강한 MDL_SHARED_WRITE를 쓴다는 소스 주석의 보수적 복원을 포함하며, 모든 namespace의 MDL을 뜻하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-xa-mdl-backup"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C017","claim_ko":"InnoDB lock hash table 초기 크기는 buffer pool page 수의 5배로 정해지고, buffer pool 크기가 크게 바뀌면 같은 식으로 srv_lock_table_size를 다시 계산해 lock_sys_resize를 호출한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/handler/ha_innodb.cc","symbol":"srv_lock_table_size","line_start":5029,"line_end":5061,"file_sha256":"42e7ad557071037a82440c01e34740615663963711dd5691c9226d69a6ec4ea8","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_resize","line_start":2629,"line_end":2640,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"이는 hash cell sizing 식이지 memory 상한이나 lock 개수 상한을 직접 뜻하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-performance"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C018","claim_ko":"InnoDB는 동일 page의 여러 record request를 bitmap 하나의 lock_t에 압축할 수 있고, impl=true 변경 fast path에서는 대기가 없으면 explicit lock_t 생성을 생략한다. 트랜잭션 종료 시 lock heap도 객체별 free 대신 한 번에 비운다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/include/lock0priv.h","symbol":"lock_rec_t","line_start":83,"line_end":91,"file_sha256":"2c035baaf4a24ed0d3d2daa68cdcbf73a81b2c77d89965ecdf530c26b3326ea0","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_rec_lock_fast","line_start":1594,"line_end":1678,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_trx_release_locks","line_start":5797,"line_end":5850,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"실제 workload별 메모리 절감률과 contention 비용은 runtime 측정하지 않았다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-performance"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C019","claim_ko":"InnoDB는 deadlock, timeout, waiting threads, record/table request·create·remove 카운터를 제공하고, Performance Schema data_locks/data_lock_waits는 lock_sys shard를 restartable batch로 스캔한다. transaction status에는 lock struct 수, heap bytes, row lock 수가 출력된다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/srv/srv0mon.cc","symbol":"MONITOR_MODULE_LOCK","line_start":125,"line_end":193,"file_sha256":"5490df1065f3233683280fbdbef943f7998db7524da3954136be635b21c9fc0e","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/handler/p_s.cc","symbol":"Innodb_data_lock_iterator","line_start":43,"line_end":132,"file_sha256":"958f029685f6e5b376f821379169bc1fa0641ee5bf49ec585dc9cdabbd347e08","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_print_low","line_start":2580,"line_end":2704,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"Performance Schema snapshot은 전체 원자적 snapshot이 아니라 chunk 단위 일관성이라는 구현 주석의 한계가 있다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-observability"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C022","claim_ko":"InnoDB consistent read는 LOCK_NONE branch에서 transaction read view를 열고, view는 생성자 transaction과 active transaction ID 경계를 기록해 DB_TRX_ID 변경의 가시성을 판정한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0sel.cc","symbol":"row_search_mvcc","line_start":4437,"line_end":4848,"file_sha256":"418edef00f0a8cba8875deac251f0581ceb98f16af99fac296eab2136b78aa1b","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_assign_read_view","line_start":2350,"line_end":2366,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/read/read0read.cc","symbol":"ReadView::prepare","line_start":436,"line_end":464,"file_sha256":"e6eb19c27aebf78275cf71af074b3641c9f5dc4a982c87e296a6ee1147f1d840","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/include/read0types.h","symbol":"changes_visible","line_start":156,"line_end":175,"file_sha256":"5e4eb1bfe122d01057007ace295adfa7364fa0c1ce1ab7fbafd72e2f4b93916a","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"Serializable 격리 수준과 read-only server 최적화 예외는 별도이며, LOCK_NONE은 lock_sys에 저장되는 lock mode가 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-mvcc-operation-matrix"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C023","claim_ko":"InnoDB locking read는 select_lock_type이 S이면 table IS, X이면 table IX를 먼저 요청하고, 검색한 index record/gap에는 같은 S/X select_lock_type의 record lock을 요청한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0sel.cc","symbol":"row_search_mvcc","line_start":4437,"line_end":4859,"file_sha256":"418edef00f0a8cba8875deac251f0581ceb98f16af99fac296eab2136b78aa1b","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0sel.cc","symbol":"sel_set_rec_lock","line_start":5039,"line_end":5060,"file_sha256":"418edef00f0a8cba8875deac251f0581ceb98f16af99fac296eab2136b78aa1b","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"gap/next-key 선택은 isolation과 index search 형태에 따라 달라지며 이 claim은 공통 의사결정만 말한다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-mvcc-operation-matrix"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C024","claim_ko":"InnoDB UPDATE는 table IX를 확보한 뒤 clustered/secondary record 수정 전에 X lock 충돌을 검사하고, clustered update에서는 lock 확인 후 undo record를 기록한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0upd.cc","symbol":"row_upd_step","line_start":3239,"line_end":3317,"file_sha256":"b17615a2fe9e27bfb13f61453a42323485b39bcd076dfe3cac9a51bad5bdda06","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/btr/btr0cur.cc","symbol":"btr_cur_upd_lock_and_undo","line_start":3073,"line_end":3122,"file_sha256":"107f89e02adef0e504c02298f9d4d7cdfc6f4306094fdc5725f1193624e8b2de","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_clust_rec_modify_check_and_lock","line_start":5239,"line_end":5353,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"secondary-index maintenance의 모든 branch와 online DDL 예외는 포함하지 않았다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-mvcc-operation-matrix"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C025","claim_ko":"InnoDB INSERT state machine은 table IX를 확보하고 transaction ID를 insert node buffer에 기록한다. record modify의 impl=true fast path는 충돌이 없으면 explicit lock_t를 만들지 않고 새 record의 DB_TRX_ID가 implicit X owner를 표현한다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0ins.cc","symbol":"row_ins_step","line_start":3644,"line_end":3733,"file_sha256":"4663213c4e443450323908184eae6477c63cf5e376cfa7385b3400fcc19c4f30","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_rec_lock_fast","line_start":1594,"line_end":1678,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/include/lock0priv.h","symbol":"implicit lock","line_start":344,"line_end":445,"file_sha256":"2c035baaf4a24ed0d3d2daa68cdcbf73a81b2c77d89965ecdf530c26b3326ea0","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"unique/FK candidate lock과 retry는 기존 MYSQL-C021이 담당하며 여기서는 insert의 IX/implicit owner만 다룬다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-mvcc-operation-matrix"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C028","claim_ko":"정상 실행의 InnoDB lock_sys와 wait slots/queues는 startup 때 새 메모리 구조로 생성되고 shutdown 때 파기된다. restart에서 source-confirmed된 잠금 복구는 undo-derived table ID로 IX lock을 재생성하는 별도 reconstruction 경로이므로, runtime lock_t queue 자체를 durable state로 해석하면 안 된다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_create","line_start":289,"line_end":316,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_close","line_start":433,"line_end":461,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_resurrect_locks","line_start":820,"line_end":872,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_table_ix_resurrect","line_start":3611,"line_end":3629,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"redo/undo의 모든 record layout을 전수 부정하는 claim이 아니며, 확인된 in-memory lifecycle과 명시적 IX reconstruction의 구분에 한정한다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-durability-boundary"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C033","claim_ko":"이번 pinned-source 감사만으로는 crash 직전의 개별 record-lock wait queue, waiter 순서, 공정성 또는 starvation 상태가 restart 뒤 동일하게 재생되는지 확정할 수 없다. 확인된 양의 복구 경로는 recovered transaction과 table IX reconstruction이다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"unknown","confidence":"UNKNOWN","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/trx/trx0trx.cc","symbol":"trx_resurrect_locks","line_start":737,"line_end":872,"file_sha256":"3128c6a43a6ed4e6465f4b28cc6eff5b3a6ad6e6d4a3e6f03b7788ece7d9cf65","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/lock/lock0lock.cc","symbol":"lock_sys_create","line_start":289,"line_end":316,"file_sha256":"f980965075e998cb30a982223411f383c9052d092ad69ebfe5b5aeb5b3726550","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"server runtime/crash experiment와 모든 redo/undo serializer 역추적을 수행하지 않았다. 이 claim은 비등가 결론의 근거가 아니라 독자에게 과잉 일반화를 막는 비중심 경계다.","report_locations":["chapters/12-mysql.html#mysql-na-unknowns"]}
